Doubletake GUI — unofficial frontend, version 1.0.0 (2026-11-09)

This is an independent graphical interface for the Doubletake AirPlay sender.
It is not affiliated with, supported by, or an official release of the
upstream project or its author.

Main project: omarroth/doubletake
Repository:   https://github.com/omarroth/doubletake
Upstream author and contributors: omarroth and Doubletake contributors

Doubletake GUI is an optional controller that executes the user's separately
installed doubletake and doubletake-ctl programs. This release contains no
upstream source code or executable binaries. All AirPlay functionality is
provided by the separately installed upstream project.

Doubletake GUI: LGPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE and COPYING.GPL).
Upstream Doubletake: refer to the original repository's LICENSE and
COPYING.GPL files, and the license applicable to the version installed.

Application icon: original artwork created for this frontend.
